{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/20262GQ3i0buEo1795770777.png?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>天水圍今日（27日）下午約1時發生一宗涉及穿梭小巴、私家車及單車的3車相撞交通意外，導致3名駕駛者受傷，包括手臂受傷的單車漢，以及另外兩車的一男一女司機，3人全部送往天水圍醫院治理。</p><p><p><img alt=\"vlcsnap-2026-11-27-16h54m32s618.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026tgPn9UgJQr1795770746.png?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p><p><img alt=\"vlcsnap-2026-11-27-16h54m34s247.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026kHekgJYwp31795770753.png?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p>網上流傳的車Cam影片還原事發經過，當時片主駕車停在燈位前，對面行人過路處正有多名途人橫過馬路。期間一輛淺藍色私家車沿天耀路駛至天河路交界，與對面方向駛至的小巴迎頭相撞；私家車車頭隨即冒出白煙，並被小巴推撞向後方「倒車」，撞中正踩單車橫過馬路的男子。單車漢人仰車翻、「大字形」倒臥路面，緊貼私家車車尾險被捲入車底，身旁另一名過路途人亦驚險避開。</p><p></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-27T10:23:55.762412+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":264,"images":3,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-27T09:12:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-28T03:17:13.528741+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-27T10:17:15.880179+00:00","content_hash":"29207937090215d17f04bdd419aba7d0e9ec2396841e1f0693fa5c8523e94cd2","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-27T10:23:55.762412+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}